## Mentioned all 3 branches are standalone, It supports every device atleast on Snapdragon (Low > Flagship till >>sm8650<<) 
**and not all but few Mediatek devices also supports**

## It's HIDL Dolby and will not work on AIDL device like sm8750 or any newer device

